-------------------

sources/mscp/upstream/ is an unmodified copy of parts of the NIST macOS
Security Compliance Project (mSCP):

  Project:  https://github.com/usnistgov/macos_security
  Release:  release_27.0 (see sources/mscp/source.json for the exact commit)
  Licence:  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
            https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The upstream licence text is in sources/mscp/upstream/LICENSE.md.

baselines/mscp/ and the discovery scripts generated by the web UI are adapted
from that material: the rules were converted to a normalized format, ODV
values are substituted, and checks are assembled into scripts. This content
was modified by this project. It remains licensed under CC BY 4.0 and is
provided as-is, with the disclaimer of warranties and limitation of liability
in section 5 of that licence.

sources/asd_ism/upstream/ is an unmodified copy of the Information Security
Manual (ISM) published by the Australian Signals Directorate (ASD), in OSCAL
format:

  Project:  https://github.com/AustralianCyberSecurityCentre/ism-oscal
            (a mirror; the authoritative copy is
            https://www.cyber.gov.au/ism/oscal)
  Release:  v2026.09.4 (September 2026 ISM)
  Licence:  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
            https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

ASD's copyright notice and disclaimer for the material are in
sources/asd_ism/upstream/README.md. The copyright notice reads: (c)
