baselines/_overlays/scripts/*.ps1 (referenced by baselines/_overlays/rules/asd-blueprint-*.json)
are PowerShell scripts from ASD's Blueprint for Secure Cloud:

  Project:  https://github.com/ASD-Blueprint/ASD-Blueprint-for-Secure-Cloud
  Commit:   a6e1e5f95e6051f23d2e7d1148c8fd57a6614000
  Path:     static/content/files/config-scripts/

Each script keeps its original header, including Microsoft's copyright and
licence comment. They are copied byte for byte, except that
UserApplicationHardeningRemoveFeatures was split by this project into three
scripts, RemovePowerShellV2.ps1, RemoveDotNet35.ps1 and
RemoveInternetExplorer.ps1. Each split script keeps the original header, adds
one comment line saying it was split, and otherwise holds its feature's original
lines unmodified apart from line endings (LF) and a final newline.

